Ya.

1045
01:24:08,177 --> 01:24:09,410
Piper.

1046
01:24:11,814 --> 01:24:12,815
Andy?

1047
01:24:15,350 --> 01:24:16,551
Piper.

1048
01:24:24,659 --> 01:24:26,162
♪ Bagaimana wajahku bisa ♪

1049
01:24:26,262 --> 01:24:28,696
♪ Terlihat begitu sempurna dan memesona ♪

1050
01:24:30,331 --> 01:24:31,299
♪ Kenapa aku selalu tampak begitu sempurna ♪

1051
01:24:31,399 --> 01:24:32,634
♪ Setiap saat ♪

1052
01:24:44,780 --> 01:24:46,648
Piper.

1053
01:24:46,749 --> 01:24:47,715
Andy?

1054
01:24:50,886 --> 01:24:51,887
Kenapa kau di sini?

1055
01:24:56,025 --> 01:24:57,426
Kau cium baunya?

1056
01:24:58,227 --> 01:24:59,995
Piper...

1057
01:25:00,830 --> 01:25:01,831
Andy?

1058
01:25:11,639 --> 01:25:13,242
Hei.

1059
01:25:13,341 --> 01:25:14,777
Kenapa disini, sayang?

1060
01:25:20,015 --> 01:25:21,283
Kudengar Andy.

1061
01:25:21,382 --> 01:25:23,152
Tidak, dia dibawah.

1062
01:25:23,252 --> 01:25:24,854
Mau meminta maaf.

1063
01:25:27,056 --> 01:25:27,990
Ayo.

1064
01:25:28,090 --> 01:25:29,758
Siapa dia?

1065
01:25:30,358 --> 01:25:31,559
Ollie.

1066
01:25:32,727 --> 01:25:34,462
- Tapi kudengar...
- Ayo, sayang.

1067
01:25:36,131 --> 01:25:37,599
Kuantar ke Andy.

1068
01:25:38,433 --> 01:25:39,667
Kupegang.

1069
01:25:40,501 --> 01:25:42,204
Dia akan baik -baik saja.

1070
01:25:42,304 --> 01:25:43,906
Ollie tak apa. Jalan sini.

1071
01:25:59,487 --> 01:26:01,991
Lewat sini.

1072
01:26:05,127 --> 01:26:06,528
Rambut Ollie warna apa?

1073
01:26:07,263 --> 01:26:09,430
Merah. Tebal dan keriting.

1074
01:26:10,065 --> 01:26:11,066
Kenapa?

1075
01:26:16,704 --> 01:26:17,740
Hei.

1076
01:26:20,109 --> 01:26:21,110
Tak apa?

1077
01:26:27,316 --> 01:26:28,549
Kemana, sayang?

1078
01:26:29,818 --> 01:26:31,820
Piper! Tidak!

1079
01:26:33,255 --> 01:26:34,957
Piper, ada apa?

1080
01:26:35,057 --> 01:26:36,491
Ayolah.

1081
01:26:36,591 --> 01:26:38,559
Buka pintunya, sayang, cepat.

1082
01:26:40,095 --> 01:26:42,563
Jangan main-main, cepat.

1083
01:26:42,664 --> 01:26:45,868
Ada apa?

1084
01:26:46,467 --> 01:26:47,669
Piper.

1085
01:26:51,539 --> 01:26:53,008
Piper, buka pintunya, sayang.

1086
01:26:59,714 --> 01:27:00,849
Jangan main-main.

1087
01:27:00,950 --> 01:27:02,117
Buka pintunya.

1088
01:27:12,261 --> 01:27:13,461
Tidak.

1089
01:27:14,830 --> 01:27:15,831
Tidak, Andy!

1090
01:27:17,532 --> 01:27:18,934
Andy, ayolah.

1091
01:27:19,034 --> 01:27:21,070
Grapefruit. Kumohon!

1092
01:27:21,170 --> 01:27:22,637
Ayo, Andy!

1093
01:27:23,339 --> 01:27:24,639
Bangun, grape...

1094
01:27:25,174 --> 01:27:26,507
Grapefruit!

1095
01:27:26,607 --> 01:27:27,977
Grapefruit!

1096
01:27:28,077 --> 01:27:29,178
Andy!

1097
01:27:31,413 --> 01:27:32,613
Kumohon!

1098
01:27:38,053 --> 01:27:39,121
Maafkan aku.

1099
01:27:53,202 --> 01:27:54,236
Hei.

1100
01:27:56,604 --> 01:27:57,806
Ada apa, sayang?

1101
01:27:59,108 --> 01:28:00,976
Apa yang menimpa Andy?

1102
01:28:02,811 --> 01:28:04,046
Dia kecelakaan.

1103
01:28:07,082 --> 01:28:08,083
Dengar.

1104
01:28:08,917 --> 01:28:10,618
Ada rahasia yang harus kuberitahu.

1105
01:28:10,718 --> 01:28:11,887
Aku takut beritahu...

1106
01:28:11,987 --> 01:28:14,089
karena aku tak mau menakutimu.

1107
01:28:16,724 --> 01:28:18,726
Aku sudah berbicara dengan Malaikat.

1108
01:28:21,230 --> 01:28:22,765
Malaikat sangat cantik.

1109
01:28:25,167 --> 01:28:26,769
Membuat keajaiban.

1110
01:28:28,504 --> 01:28:30,739
Dia merasuki Ollie.

1111
01:28:34,943 --> 01:28:35,978
Sekarang,

1112
01:28:38,347 --> 01:28:40,249
Cathy akan merasukimu.

1113
01:28:42,017 --> 01:28:43,752
Karena kau mirip dia.

1114
01:28:45,287 --> 01:28:47,156
Sama luar biasa dan...

1115
01:28:49,124 --> 01:28:50,159
sempurna.

1116
01:28:52,593 --> 01:28:53,929
Kau mau apakan aku?

1117
01:28:56,231 --> 01:28:58,333
Mau kutenggelamkan di kolam, sayang.

1118
01:29:02,004 --> 01:29:03,638
Jangan!

1119
01:31:25,814 --> 01:31:27,749
- Jangan halangi aku!
- Jangan, kumohon!

1120
01:31:27,849 --> 01:31:29,751
Biarkan saja!

1121
01:31:31,320 --> 01:31:32,387
Kumohon, Piper!

1122
01:31:35,390 --> 01:31:36,425
Tidak!

1123
01:31:45,334 --> 01:31:46,368
Hujanlah lebih deras!

1124
01:31:52,341 --> 01:31:53,475
Bertahanlah.

1125
01:31:54,543 --> 01:31:55,744
Kumohon bertahanlah!

1126
01:31:56,278 --> 01:31:58,947
Tidak!

1127
01:32:10,192 --> 01:32:12,494
Ibu!

1128
01:32:17,032 --> 01:32:18,233
Ibu.

1129
01:32:19,635 --> 01:32:20,869
Ibu.

1130
01:33:15,657 --> 01:33:16,858
Oh, tidak!

1131
01:33:17,760 --> 01:33:18,994
Piper!

1132
01:33:19,728 --> 01:33:21,363
Piper!

1133
01:33:23,999 --> 01:33:26,134
Maafkan aku!

1134
01:33:39,381 --> 01:33:40,415
Piper!

1135
01:33:40,515 --> 01:33:41,483
Piper!

1136
01:35:01,163 --> 01:35:03,231
Kau tak apa?
Asalmu dari mana?

1137
01:35:24,953 --> 01:35:26,254
Cathy.

1138
01:35:28,256 --> 01:35:29,257
Cathy?

1139
01:35:30,927 --> 01:35:32,127
Sayang?

1140
01:35:34,764 --> 01:35:36,331
Hei.

1141
01:35:36,431 --> 01:35:37,499
Hei, cantik.

1142
01:35:40,101 --> 01:35:41,336
Syukurlah.

1143
01:35:43,104 --> 01:35:44,372
Disini rupanya.

1144
01:35:44,473 --> 01:35:45,474
Kau tak apa?

1145
01:36:17,005 --> 01:36:18,273
Inilah saatnya.

1146
01:36:24,346 --> 01:36:25,413
Berhenti!

1147
01:36:44,767 --> 01:36:46,134
<i>Mungkin kau tidak...</i>

1148
01:36:46,234 --> 01:36:47,402
<i>peduli, tapi…</i>

1149
01:36:50,071 --> 01:36:51,373
<i>aku menyayangimu, Pipe.</i>

1150
01:36:54,609 --> 01:36:55,644
<i>Grapefruit.</i>

1151
01:37:22,404 --> 01:37:24,907
Teman-teman! Di sini!

1152
01:37:25,007 --> 01:37:27,409
Ada seorang bocah!

1153
01:37:27,509 --> 01:37:29,011
Kami akan tolong, kawan.

1154
01:37:29,110 --> 01:37:30,712
Ambilkan selimut!

1155
01:37:30,813 --> 01:37:32,147
- Hei.
- Kira, hubungi ambulans.

1156
01:37:32,247 --> 01:37:33,950
- Tolong.
- Tenanglah.

1157
01:37:34,050 --> 01:37:36,351
Panggil ambulans, ini kasus 117.

1158
01:37:36,451 --> 01:37:38,253
Tak apa. Siapa namamu?

1159
01:37:38,687 --> 01:37:39,688
Aku...

1160
01:37:40,522 --> 01:37:41,690
Connor.

1161
01:37:41,791 --> 01:37:42,959
Connor Bird.

1162
01:37:43,059 --> 01:37:45,126
Hebat. Connor, pegang.

1163
01:37:45,226 --> 01:37:47,329
Pegang aku. Tidak lama lagi, ya?

1164
01:37:48,300 --> 01:38:08,300
